@startuml
[*] --> Start_Trip_Planning
Start_Trip_Planning --> Input_Preferences : Input travel dates, times, preferences
Input_Preferences --> Fetch_Data : Fetch flight, train, hotel info
Fetch_Data --> Generate_Itinerary : Combine data to create itinerary
Generate_Itinerary --> Save_Itinerary : Save the itinerary
Save_Itinerary --> Access_Itinerary : Access saved itinerary
Access_Itinerary --> [*] : End trip planning
Generate_Itinerary --> Modify_Preferences : Modify preferences
Modify_Preferences --> Input_Preferences : Re-input preferences
Save_Itinerary --> Generate_Itinerary : Re-generate itinerary
@enduml
